WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.440
Soil, Seed & Water is introducing our garden bed. An 8 by 4

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.720
foot design with steel corner

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.260
posts and room to grow.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.720
So the same garden beds that are on our giveaways are also

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.160
going to be added to our inventory.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.840
Not only that, but we have also put together a beautiful demo

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.500
video so that you know

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.040
exactly how you need to put it together.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.500
This design uses 4 steel posts and 12 boards. 6 long and 6

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.120
short, stacked in 3 courses.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.020
With a second person, slide the boards into the corner slots.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.360
Keep the frame square

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.960
and secure it with the specified hardware before filling.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.260
Start the filling sequence with pea gravel at the bottom for

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.760
drainage. Follow your site

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.120
and planting plan for the amount.

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:42.280
Place soil cloth on top of the pea gravel and fit it into the

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.560
corners. This helps

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.520
keep fine soil particles from clogging the pea gravel drainage

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:46.860
layer.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.380
Above the cloth, add a layer of clean raw wood chips. This is

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.460
inside the bed, below

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:53.400
the rich potting soil.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.340
Add rich potting soil above the wood chips. Top it off with

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:58.440
Nature's Blanket, our

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.240
dark, chocolate brown mulch, enhanced with compost and worm

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.740
castings. From bottom to

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:06.600
top, pea gravel, soil cloth, clean raw wood chips, rich potting

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:07.860
soil and Nature's Blanket.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:13.160
So we have the garden beds for $599 for a limited

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.100
time only. So please, go in if

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.960
you want these beds, hit us up, let us know.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:23.320
For a limited time, get your garden bed kit for just $599.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.280
It includes 4 steel

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:27.980
posts, lumber, pea gravel and soil cloth.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.860
Delivery, soil, mulch and amendments are sold separately. Now

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.240
taking orders at Organic

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.280
Soil Wholesale. Choose your quantity online. No payment

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:37.980
required today.
